Note, Hangman Game with graphical UI.

Note, Word list.
Create a list called words.
Add hut to words.
Add eis to words.
Add bus to words.
Add hai to words.
Add tor to words.
Add kuh to words.
Add baum to words.
Add auto to words.
Add buch to words.
Add hund to words.
Add mond to words.
Add apfel to words.
Add stern to words.
Add blume to words.
Add pferd to words.
Add tisch to words.
Add banane to words.
Add garten to words.
Add wasser to words.
Add kaffee to words.
Add giraffe to words.
Add fahrrad to words.
Add flasche to words.
Add spiegel to words.
Add elefant to words.
Add computer to words.
Add fussball to words.
Add rucksack to words.
Add fernseher to words.
Add kartoffel to words.
Add schokolade to words.
Add wasserfall to words.

Note, Pick a random word.
Let word count be the length of words.
Let wordid be a random number between 1 and the value of word count.
Let word be item the value of wordid of words.
Let word length be the length of word.

Note, Game state.
Create a list called guessed.
Let lives be 6.
Let game over be 0.
Let chosen letter be 0.
Let display word be waiting.

Note, Drawing functions.

Define draw gallows,
    Set pen speed to 0.
    Set pen size to 4.
    Set pen color to #6c7086.
    Note, Base line.
    Pen up.
    Move to negative 90 and negative 100.
    Pen down.
    Move to negative 10 and negative 100.
    Note, Vertical pole.
    Pen up.
    Move to negative 50 and negative 100.
    Pen down.
    Move to negative 50 and 120.
    Note, Top beam.
    Move to 10 and 120.
    Note, Support bracket.
    Set pen size to 2.
    Pen up.
    Move to negative 50 and 90.
    Pen down.
    Move to negative 30 and 120.
    Note, Rope.
    Set pen size to 2.
    Set pen color to #a6adc8.
    Pen up.
    Move to 10 and 120.
    Pen down.
    Move to 10 and 90.
    Pen up.
End define.

Define draw head,
    Set pen speed to 0.
    Set pen size to 3.
    Set pen color to #f38ba8.
    Pen up.
    Move to 10 and 50.
    Pen down.
    Draw circle with radius 20.
    Pen up.
End define.

Define draw body,
    Set pen speed to 0.
    Set pen size to 3.
    Set pen color to #f38ba8.
    Pen up.
    Move to 10 and 50.
    Pen down.
    Move to 10 and negative 10.
    Pen up.
End define.

Define draw left arm,
    Set pen speed to 0.
    Set pen size to 3.
    Set pen color to #f38ba8.
    Pen up.
    Move to 10 and 40.
    Pen down.
    Move to negative 25 and 15.
    Pen up.
End define.

Define draw right arm,
    Set pen speed to 0.
    Set pen size to 3.
    Set pen color to #f38ba8.
    Pen up.
    Move to 10 and 40.
    Pen down.
    Move to 45 and 15.
    Pen up.
End define.

Define draw left leg,
    Set pen speed to 0.
    Set pen size to 3.
    Set pen color to #f38ba8.
    Pen up.
    Move to 10 and negative 10.
    Pen down.
    Move to negative 20 and negative 55.
    Pen up.
End define.

Define draw right leg,
    Set pen speed to 0.
    Set pen size to 3.
    Set pen color to #f38ba8.
    Pen up.
    Move to 10 and negative 10.
    Pen down.
    Move to 40 and negative 55.
    Pen up.
End define.

Define draw hangman,
    Call draw gallows.
    Let wrong count be 6 minus the value of lives.
    If the value of wrong count is greater than or equal to 1,
        Call draw head.
    End if.
    If the value of wrong count is greater than or equal to 2,
        Call draw body.
    End if.
    If the value of wrong count is greater than or equal to 3,
        Call draw left arm.
    End if.
    If the value of wrong count is greater than or equal to 4,
        Call draw right arm.
    End if.
    If the value of wrong count is greater than or equal to 5,
        Call draw left leg.
    End if.
    If the value of wrong count is greater than or equal to 6,
        Call draw right leg.
    End if.
End define.

Note, Build the display word with spaces between letters.

Define build display word,
    Let pos be 1.
    Let current char be the substring of word from 1 to 1.
    If the value of guessed contains the value of current char,
        Let display word be the value of current char.
    Otherwise,
        Let display word be underscore.
    End if.
    Set pos to 2.
    While the value of pos is less than or equal to the value of word length,
        Let current char be the substring of word from the value of pos to the value of pos.
        If the value of guessed contains the value of current char,
            Let display word be the value of display word plus the value of current char.
        Otherwise,
            Let display word be the value of display word plus underscore.
        End if.
        Add 1 to pos.
    End while.
End define.

Note, Check if the word is fully solved.

Define check solved,
    Let all found be 1.
    Let check pos be 1.
    While the value of check pos is less than or equal to the value of word length,
        Let check char be the substring of word from the value of check pos to the value of check pos.
        If the value of guessed contains the value of check char,
            Note, already found.
        Otherwise,
            Set all found to 0.
        End if.
        Add 1 to check pos.
    End while.
    If the value of all found is equal to 1,
        Set game over to 2.
    End if.
End define.

Note, Main guess handler.

Define guess letter,
    If the value of game over is greater than 0,
        Note, game is over.
    Otherwise,
        Let letter be the value of chosen letter.
        If the value of guessed contains the value of letter,
            Note, already guessed.
        Otherwise,
            Add the value of letter to guessed.
            Let found pos be the position of the value of letter in word.
            If the value of found pos is equal to 0,
                Subtract 1 from lives.
                If the value of lives is equal to 0,
                    Set game over to 1.
                End if.
            End if.
            Call check solved.
            Call show game.
        End if.
    End if.
End define.

Note, Letter button handlers.

Define pick a,
    Set chosen letter to a.
    Call guess letter.
End define.

