Note, New game handler.

Define new game,
    Let wordid be a random number between 1 and the value of word count.
    Set word to item the value of wordid of words.
    Set word length to the length of word.
    Create a list called guessed.
    Set lives to 6.
    Set game over to 0.
    Call show game.
End define.

Note, Main screen.

Define show game,
    Clear window.
    Set title to Hangman.

    Note, Draw the hangman figure.
    Call draw hangman.

    Note, Show the word.
    Call build display word.
    Set font size to 28.
    Set text color to #cdd6f4.
    Add label the value of display word.

    Note, Show game status.
    If the value of game over is equal to 1,
        Set font size to 18.
        Set text color to #f38ba8.
        Add label Game Over.
        Set font size to 14.
        Set text color to #a6adc8.
        Add label The word was plus the value of word.
        Set font size to 13.
        Set text color to #cdd6f4.
        Add button with text New Game that calls new game.
    Otherwise if the value of game over is equal to 2,
        Set font size to 18.
        Set text color to #a6e3a1.
        Add label You won.
        Set font size to 13.
        Set text color to #cdd6f4.
        Add button with text New Game that calls new game.
    Otherwise,
        Set font size to 11.
        Set text color to #a6adc8.
        Add label Lives plus the value of lives.

        Note, Letter buttons.
        Set font size to 12.
        Set text color to #cdd6f4.
        Add button with text A that calls pick a.
        Add button with text B that calls pick b.
        Add button with text C that calls pick c.
        Add button with text D that calls pick d.
        Add button with text E that calls pick e.
        Add button with text F that calls pick f.
        Add button with text G that calls pick g.
        Add button with text H that calls pick h.
        Add button with text I that calls pick i.
        Add button with text J that calls pick j.
        Add button with text K that calls pick k.
        Add button with text L that calls pick l.
        Add button with text M that calls pick m.
        Add button with text N that calls pick n.
        Add button with text O that calls pick o.
        Add button with text P that calls pick p.
        Add button with text Q that calls pick q.
        Add button with text R that calls pick r.
        Add button with text S that calls pick s.
        Add button with text T that calls pick t.
        Add button with text U that calls pick u.
        Add button with text V that calls pick v.
        Add button with text W that calls pick w.
        Add button with text X that calls pick x.
        Add button with text Y that calls pick y.
        Add button with text Z that calls pick z.
    End if.
End define.

Note, Start the game.
Open window with title Hangman.
Set window size to 540 by 820.
Call show game.
Wait for close.
